  id: strange_wolf_fangs
  displayName: Stange Fangs
  description: 'You! You came from over there, did you not? Did you see the animals
    there? Yes, yes, the wolves! There is something odd about them, and I intend
    to investigate rather than just putting them down with a spear, and letting two
    more take the scoundrels place. Speaking of "putting down", why do you not go
    over there and fetch me some of their teeth? They would do good for studying! '
